		{
			"id": "ewB_P4B4REWQyvAbp",
			"description": "Blastmaster",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The blastmaster is the Noise Marines' heavy sonic weapon: a big emitter on the shoulder or a brace, with a setting for sweeping many frequencies and another that picks one to shatter a single target (Codex: Chaos Space Marines; Noise Marine fiction).\n\nDesign: Damage and rate from the Chaos anchor: varied frequency 6dx2(3) cr, RoF 2, range 120/360; single frequency 6dx3(5) cr, RoF 1. Both lines share handling. Heavy weapon, so it is braced: weight 80 lb, near the Heavy Bolter's 85 lb, and ST 14B with a bipod, as the Heavy Bolter. Bulk -7, in the framework's heavy/support band of -6 to -8. Skill is Gunner (Cannon) rather than Gunner (Machine Gun) or Guns (Light Machine Gun): RoF 2 or 1 is single-emitter fire like the Autocannon's, not the Heavy Bolter's automatic stream, and the framework puts braced and mounted heavies under Gunner. Rcl 2, below the Heavy Bolter's 4: a beam of sound has no projectile momentum. Acc 5 and shots 20(4). By exact dice, varied frequency penetrates Mark VII (effective DR 33) 85.5% of the time and Tartaros 0.5%; single frequency penetrates Mark VII always and Tartaros 98%, so the single setting kills Terminators, like a lascannon at lower power.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Chaos",
				"Slaanesh",
				"Noise Marine"
			],
			"tech_level": "10",
			"legality_class": "0",
