			"description": "Blight Grenade",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Death Guard Plague Marines throw blight grenades, whose casings hold a filth that rots flesh and corrodes metal. They are the plague-god's answer to the frag grenade (Codex: Death Guard).\n\nDesign: The Frag Grenade's line, copied: 3d cr ex [4d cut], Throwing, 1 lb. Chaos anchor in framework.md adds a 1d tox follow-up per fragment, so the burst injures the same way and a fragment that gets through DR also poisons. Cost $60 against the Frag Grenade's $20. TL 8, LC 0.",
